        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Elisa kolimokinite aberu naetaiarikini ŋesi okokuke ebe, “Konyou, kolot ijo ka lukokalekon, kiboikin neipedoria aiboiororor; naarai anyarau. EJAKAIT ebeli; edauni ebeli ikar ikanykaarei kakwap.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
