            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kolot Kasael airiamun kaŋes, koyana ainakinet, naka ninioore yenejok yeniko Damasiko, naebwokito akaalai akaisaoŋon, kobu kobwo kakonyeneke, kotema atiar, “Okokukon Ben-kadad ekabaka loka Suria ŋes keyakuunit neijai ebala ebe, ‘Aŋaleuni adeka na?’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kotema Elisa ŋes atiar, “Kolot, kolimok ŋes ebe, ‘Abeit iŋaleuni.’ Konye ketodikinite EJAKAIT eoŋ ebe abeit etwani.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kosesen noi aitodol naeleicikinio: komony etuŋanan loka Edeke akiyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
