          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kotema Kasael atiar, “Inyo bo emonyi ekaiakait?” Koboŋok ebe, “Naarai ajeni aronis naiswamakini ijo idwe luka Isirael: icwei abwasinikee kakim, iari itelepaikec kekilen, ilatanari ludidikikee, iŋerereanari akecenor nuepotiete.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
