        {
          "text": "Kotema Kasael atiar, “Konye ekonikejaanakinan ŋes inyo, loerai ekiŋok cur, aswam akirot ŋin naepol?” Koboŋok Elisa ebe, “Ketodik EJAKAIT eoŋ ebe iraun ijo ekabaka loka Suria.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.13",
