        },
        {
          "text": "Kosodi ŋesi anyoun kama ejai Elisa, kobu neejai ejakaitike; loketemari ŋes atiar, “Ebala bo Elisa ai?” Koboŋok ebe, “Kalimoki ebe abeit iŋaleuni.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
