              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kobono ekabaka Yoram aŋaleun amusuŋun koYesereel nuemusunete Isurian koRama, nakeiiotor kaKasael ekabaka loka Suria. Kolot Akasia okoku loka Yekoram ekabaka loka Yuda aanyun Yoram okoku loka Akab koYesereel, naarai adeka. ",
